Description: R implementation of the 'Stata' 'tabtools' commands
    'table1_tc', 'regtab', 'puttab', 'stacktab', 'stratetab', 'effecttab',
    'comptab' and 'hrcomptab' (version 2.1.14), and a weight-diagnostics
    table for inverse probability weighting. Produces baseline
    characteristics tables, regression tables, incidence-rate tables (with
    the rates of 'Stata' 'strate'), cohort-study tables of incidence rates
    beside hazard ratios, tables of treatment effects and margins, tables
    of the distribution of inverse probability weights, and composite
    sheets assembled from them, with row-level control over variable labels, category
    indentation, reference rows, and house-styled 'Excel', Markdown, and CSV
    output. Descriptive statistics, layout, and formatting target
    cell-for-cell parity with the 'Stata' commands; hypothesis tests use R's
    conventional defaults.
